About EG
&gt;
Engineers Gate (EG) is a leading investment manager founded in 2014 as a quantitative, computer-driven trading firm. Today, EG operates as a diversified, multi-strategy investment platform that combines systematic research with selective discretionary approaches.
EG&#x27;s multi-manager platform allows independent investment teams to pursue distinct strategies while benefiting from shared infrastructure, risk management, and operational support. The firm&#x27;s collaborative groups of researchers, engineers, and investment professionals deploy sophisticated statistical models, proprietary technology, and a centralized data platform to isolate and solve challenging problem sets in the global financial markets.
About The Role
&gt;
We&#x27;re looking for intellectually curious, driven graduate-level students to join one of our investment teams as a Quantitative Research Intern in our Singapore office.
&gt;
The intern will contribute to ongoing research across signal development and data infrastructure and will gain hands-on exposure to the full quantitative research process. The internship offers the opportunity to be considered for a full-time Quantitative Researcher role.
&gt;
Key Responsibilities
&gt;
Research and develop alpha signals that combine sound economic reasoning with rigorous statistical validation
&gt;
Scout, read, digest, and implement research papers competently and efficiently
&gt;
Develop reusable research tools that make the research process faster and more robust
&gt;
Write clean, well-documented, production-quality code
&gt;
Communicate findings and recommendations clearly
&gt;
Turn raw, varied datasets into clean, validated inputs for global equities alpha research
&gt;
Qualifications
&gt;
Master&#x27;s degree in Mathematics, Physics, Computer Science, Engineering or a related field
&gt;
Excellent attention to detail and strong written and verbal communication
&gt;
Strong programming skills in Python
&gt;
Strong mathematical, statistical, programming, and problem-solving skills
&gt;
Financial or…

Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model - which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#x27;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#x27;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#x27;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.
&gt;
&gt; The Team
&gt;
Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact - understanding our customers&#x27; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our team pairs deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.
&gt;
The Role
&gt;
As an intern, you will have the unique opportunity to learn and grow through hands-on experiences. Your role will involve utilizing our cutting-edge AI deployment tools to develop innovative solutions for our customers, together with more experienced Deployment Engineers.
&gt;
This is not a traditional engineering role where you…

